<section class="section page-break" id="appendices">
    <h2 class="section-title">7. Appendices & Verification</h2>

    <h3>Appendix A: Truthful Integration Status Matrix</h3>
    <p>In accordance with the hackathon transparency invariant, all scanner integrations are truthfully categorized by operational execution mode:</p>
    <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Tool</th>
                <th>Execution Mode</th>
                <th>Operational Status</th>
                <th>Capabilities & Scope</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in integration_matrix %}
            <tr>
                <td><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong></td>
                <td>
                    <span class="mode-badge mode-{{ item.mode | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ item.mode }}</span>
                </td>
                <td>{{ item.status }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.capabilities }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>Appendix B: Cryptographic Audit Trail Verification</h3>
    <div class="audit-verification-banner {{ 'verified' if audit_verified else 'unverified' }}">
        <div class="banner-title">
            {% if audit_verified %}
                &#x2714; Cryptographic SHA-256 Hash Chain Integrity: VERIFIED INTACT
            {% else %}
                &#x26A0; Cryptographic SHA-256 Hash Chain Integrity: TAMPER DETECTED / BROKEN
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        <p>Every planning step, scope decision, scanner execution, and human approval is cryptographically chained with SHA-256 hashes from genesis. Total recorded events: {{ audit_events | length }}.</p>
    </div>

    <table class="data-table audit-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Seq</th>
                <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
                <th>Actor</th>
                <th>Event Type</th>
                <th>Outcome</th>
                <th>SHA-256 Hash (Truncated)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for evt in audit_events[:20] %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ evt.seq }}</td>
                <td>{{ evt.timestamp }}</td>
                <td><code>{{ evt.actor }}</code></td>
                <td>{{ evt.event_type }}</td>
                <td><span class="outcome-tag outcome-{{ evt.outcome | lower }}">{{ evt.outcome }}</span></td>
                <td><code title="{{ evt.hash }}">{{ evt.hash[:16] }}...</code></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {% if audit_events | length > 20 %}
        <p class="table-footnote">Showing first 20 of {{ audit_events | length }} audit events. Full cryptographically verified log is available via the audit export endpoint.</p>
    {% endif %}

