        <strong>Compliance & Legal Disclaimer:</strong>
        <p>The standards and framework mappings provided herein are for informational, architectural, and risk-prioritization purposes only. This automated technical assessment does not constitute a formal regulatory compliance audit, ISO certification, or legal guarantee of immunity from cyber attack. Penetration testing was performed strictly within designated rules of engagement.</p>
